1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:16,960
School life is monotonous.

2
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:23,640
Every morning I get out of bed and run my daily training regimen out on the grounds.

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,780
Once I get back to my room, I do some magic drills.

4
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:42,800
Zanoba keeps begging me to teach him how to make figures, but I've gotten pretty rusty in these last few years.

5
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:45,100
I need to practice some more first.

6
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:51,260
I eat breakfast and lunch with Zanoba.

7
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:57,260
The university offers cuisine from all over, and a lot of it suits my palate to a tea.

8
00:00:57,260 --> 00:01:03,980
It still falls short of the Japanese cooking I remember, but there are more than enough similar dishes to keep me satisfied.

9
00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:14,860
Alina Lise gets plenty of one-on-one time with her fellow students and goes out on the town at night for extracurriculars.

10
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:19,400
You gotta give it to her. Her stamina is impressive.

11
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:27,320
In the afternoons, I take beginner-level classes in Healing, Divine, and Barrier Magic.

12
00:01:28,440 --> 00:01:36,940
Roxy taught me a little about barriers when she was my tutor, but at the time I was satisfied just to know they existed and more or less tuned out the rest.

13
00:01:37,480 --> 00:01:40,040
So starting over from the beginning ought to be helpful.

14
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:46,660
After class, I head back to the library and research teleportation until it gets dark.

15
00:01:47,220 --> 00:01:55,640
I've gone through a lot of books, but teleportation is considered a forbidden art, so it's rarely written about in detail, and never instructionally.

16
00:01:56,640 --> 00:02:02,340
In fact, exploring the teleporter labyrinth the book Master Fitz told me about might be the best source on the subject.

17
00:02:02,340 --> 00:02:08,920
I've worked out a daily routine, and I've finally begun to settle in.

18
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:14,360
But my unfettered Shogun of the night still refuses to be manly.

19
00:02:14,820 --> 00:02:17,340
One might say he is extremely fettered.

20
00:02:17,340 --> 00:02:22,940
Oh, Lord.

21
00:02:22,940 --> 00:02:23,440
Oh.

22
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:23,940
Oh.

23
