Oh.

29
00:02:30,260 --> 00:02:31,500
Oh.

30
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:31,820
Oh.

31
00:02:31,820 --> 00:02:32,160
Oh.

32
00:02:34,300 --> 00:02:38,280
Oh.

33
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:40,960
Oh.

34
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:43,480
Oh.

35
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:44,380
Oh.

36
00:02:44,380 --> 00:02:45,540
Oh.

37
